msgstr "Flere DMARC-poster funnet. Mottakere ignorerer da DMARC – behold bare én."

msgid "Multiple SPF records found. Receivers treat this as an error (PermError) – merge them into one record."
msgstr "Flere SPF-poster funnet. Mottakere behandler dette som en feil (PermError) – slå dem sammen til én post."

msgid "Needs attention"
msgstr "Trenger oppmerksomhet"

msgid "Neither a From header nor a sender was recorded. The mailer falls back to its default, often wordpress@yourdomain."
msgstr "Verken et From-hode eller en avsender ble registrert. Maileren faller tilbake til standardverdien, ofte wordpress@dittdomene."

msgid "Never"
msgstr "Aldri"

